abstract: >
  Code and experiments accompanying the paper "Hybrid Datasets for
  Emotion Classification: How Much Synthetic Data Is Too Much?",
  investigating how varying proportions of synthetic (ELSA) and real
  (DAIR-AI) training data affect emotion classification performance
  of a fine-tuned DistilRoBERTa-base model.
